    "name_raw": "Special Delivery",
    "definition_type_raw": "Teamwork",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Campaign Setting: Distant Shores",
    "definition_raw": "Your partner can carry your spells to their targets.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Bonded Mind, Share Spells, ability to deliver spells through an animal companion, eidolon, familiar, or phantom, caster level 3rd.\n\nBenefit(s): Whenever you are in contact with an ally who has the Bonded Mind feat and you cast a touch spell, you can designate the ally as the “toucher,” as per the deliver touch spells familiar ability.",
